About this property
Sun Terrace and Garden: The Villa Clover in Galle offers a sun terrace and a lush garden. Guests can relax in the outdoor spaces and enjoy free WiFi throughout the property.

Comfortable Accommodation: The villa features two bedrooms and a living room. Each room is equipped with air-conditioning, a balcony, and a kitchenette. Family rooms and a lounge provide additional comfort.

Convenient Facilities: The property includes a shared kitchen, laundry service, and free on-site private parking. Additional amenities include a lounge, barbecue facilities, and bicycle parking.

Nearby Attractions: Bonavista Beach is 2.6 km away, and Koggala Airport is 13 km from the villa. Reception staff speak English, ensuring a pleasant stay.

