owner massage
Welcome to The Villa Clover. The Villa Clover is a private, fully air-conditioned 2-bedroom villa designed for travelers seeking a blend of modern comfort, space, and authentic Sri Lankan warmth. Set in a peaceful residential neighborhood, our property offers a quiet retreat with lush garden views, a private balcony, and an exclusive rooftop terrace perfect for morning coffee or evening sunsets. What Makes The Villa Clover Unique: Spacious 2-Bedroom Layout: Ideal for families, couples, or small groups, featuring plush bedding, air conditioning, and contemporary decor. Outdoor Spaces: Unwind on our private rooftop sun terrace or relax in the lush tropical garden. Full Home Amenities: Includes a fully equipped kitchen, high-speed free Wi-Fi, private modern bathrooms, washing machine, and secure private parking. How We Make You Feel at Home: We take pride in delivering personalized hospitality. From smooth check-ins and welcoming hot tea to assisting with local transport, tuk-tuks, and insider tips for Galle Fort and nearby beaches, we are dedicated to making your stay seamless and unforgettable.
Guests love our peaceful residential setting, which offers a quiet retreat away from city noise while keeping you just 10 minutes from historic Galle Fort. You can spend your day exploring colonial streets, boutique cafes, and the Maritime Museum, or take a quick 15-minute drive to Unawatuna and Jungle Beach for swimming and snorkeling. Day trips to Hikkaduwa for coral reefs, Koggala Lake for boat safaris, and Mirissa for whale watching are also easily arranged.

-Ganidu Sasmitha



